window.AXIA_STATIC.articles = [{"slug": "fast-website", "title": "چطور یک وب‌سایت سریع بسازیم", "summary": "سرعت یک ویژگی نیست که در پایان اضافه شود؛ نتیجهٔ سه تصمیم درست از روز اول است.", "body": "## چرا سرعت مهم است\n\nکاربری که سه ثانیه منتظر می‌ماند، معمولاً برنمی‌گردد. سرعت یک ویژگی نیست که\nدر پایان پروژه اضافه شود؛ نتیجهٔ تصمیم‌هایی است که از روز اول گرفته می‌شود.\n\n## سه تصمیم که بیشترین اثر را دارند\n\n- **تصاویر را درست اندازه بگیرید.** یک تصویر ۴ مگابایتی که در قابی ۴۰۰ پیکسلی\n  نمایش داده می‌شود، فقط پهنای باند هدر نمی‌دهد، تجربه را هم خراب می‌کند.\n- **فونت را سبک نگه دارید.** یک خانوادهٔ متغیر با وزن‌های محدود، بهتر از چهار\n  فایل جداگانه است.\n- **جاوااسکریپت را به تعویق بیندازید.** کاری که برای اولین نمایش لازم نیست،\n  نباید اولین نمایش را معطل کند.\n\n## اندازه‌گیری، نه حدس\n\nپیش از هر بهینه‌سازی، عدد بگیرید. اگر ندانید صفحه در حال حاضر چند ثانیه طول\nمی‌کشد، نمی‌توانید بگویید تغییری که داده‌اید بهتر بوده یا بدتر.\n\n```html\n<img src=\"cover.webp\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"تصویر مقاله\">\n```\n\n> آنچه اندازه‌گیری نشود، بهتر نمی‌شود.\n\n## جمع‌بندی\n\nسرعت از همان ابتدا در ساختار پروژه تصمیم گرفته می‌شود. سه تصمیم بالا بدون هیچ\nابزار اضافه‌ای، بیشترین تفاوت را می‌سازند.\n", "tags": ["سرعت", "وب", "تجربه کاربری"], "language": "fa", "published_at": "2026-11-08 22:22:45", "reading_minutes": 1}];
window.AXIA_STATIC.pages = [{"topic": "services", "route": "#/services", "title": "Services", "text": "Services. From first idea to ready to grow. Flexible software development for teams who need a thoughtful partner to shape and build their next digital product.  ⌘. Website development. Responsive brand sites, storefronts, content platforms and custom web applications. ↗ . ▣. Mobile applications. Mobile product strategy and cross-platform app development for Android and iOS. ↗ . ⌘. Custom software. Purpose-built tools, integrations, business systems and workflow automation. ↗ . Our process. From question to outcome.  01 / 06 Request. Tell us what you need. 02 / 06 Discover. Align on requirements. 03 / 06 Design. Map an intuitive experience. 04 / 06 Develop. Build in reviewed stages. 05 / 06 Test. Validate quality and security. 06 / 06 Deliver. Launch and support.  Let's scope your project. We will review your brief and get back to you about next steps.  Start a project ↗ .", "aliases": "خدمات سرویس طراحی توسعه وب اپلیکیشن نرم‌افزار services development design"}, {"topic": "about", "route": "#/about", "title": "About AXIASOFT", "text": "A little about us. Good software starts with good questions. AXIASOFT is an independent software brand focused on creating digital products and custom development experiences with care, clarity and craft.  Our approach. Less noise. More useful software.  Our values. Built to be clear. Made to be trusted. We turn ideas into useful, well-considered software. We value open collaboration, responsible security practices and products that can grow without losing their purpose. ✓ Modern technologies. ✓ Custom development. ✓ Security-minded engineering. ✓ Responsive design. ✓ Ongoing support.  .", "aliases": "درباره شرکت تیم ما آکسیا سافت about company team who are you"}, {"topic": "contact", "route": "#/contact", "title": "Start a project", "text": "Start a conversation. Tell us what you're working toward. Choose a development starting point and share context. Our team will follow up to discuss scope. No payment is taken on this site.  Websites Arya — Software with wings. Arya is a complete website build presented under the Arya brand: software with wings. Request this product ↗ . Websites Ersha — Built to stand. Ersha is a complete website build presented under the Ersha brand: built to stand. Request this product ↗ . Websites Mino — Clarity, by design. Mino is a complete website build presented under the Mino brand: clarity, by design. Request this product ↗ . Websites Homa — Rise above the noise. Homa is a complete website build presented under the Homa brand: rise above the noise. Request this product ↗ .", "aliases": "تماس سفارش درخواست پروژه شروع ثبت contact order request project start quote"}, {"topic": "privacy", "route": "#/privacy", "title": "Privacy policy", "text": "AXIASOFT / INFORMATION. Privacy Policy. Overview. We collect information needed to respond to enquiries, manage accounts and provide requested services. Order and support data is used to operate this platform. Do not submit sensitive personal information in project briefs. How to request support. Data is retained as needed for delivery, security, legal obligations and dispute resolution. Contact support to request access, correction or deletion, subject to legal requirements. Review and next steps. AI support in this build uses a limited local guidance layer. Do not share passwords, payment details or sensitive data in the assistant.", "aliases": "حریم خصوصی داده اطلاعات privacy data"}, {"topic": "terms", "route": "#/terms", "title": "Terms and conditions", "text": "AXIASOFT / INFORMATION. Terms and Conditions. Overview. This development-stage platform provides product information, service enquiries and order requests. A request does not create a fixed-price contract or guarantee delivery timing. Scope, price and milestones must be confirmed separately in writing. How to request support. AURION is a symbolic presentation. Trading functionality, broker connections, payment and license activation are not operational. Trading carries risk; this site does not provide financial advice. Review and next steps. Product previews are demonstrations and may contain illustrative content. Availability, features and indicative prices are subject to confirmation.", "aliases": "قوانین شرایط استفاده terms conditions"}, {"topic": "refunds-policy", "route": "#/refunds-policy", "title": "Refund and return policy", "text": "AXIASOFT / INFORMATION. Refund and Return Policy. Overview. Customers may submit a refund request within 14 calendar days of the applicable purchase or order date if they are not satisfied, subject to the published terms and applicable law. How to request support. To request a review, sign in, open your account and submit a refund request for the relevant order. Provide the order number and reason. Support can also help. Review and next steps. Requests are reviewed against the order details, delivery status, agreed scope and applicable law. AXIASOFT communicates the decision and next steps. Approval is not an automatic refund or proof that payment was returned. Important distinctions. Custom development, completed digital products, undelivered projects and subscription or license products may be treated differently. Consumer rules vary by market; legal review is needed where AXIASOFT operates. Payment status. A refund is processed only when a real payment provider confirms it. No payment gateway is connected in this development phase.", "aliases": "بازپرداخت لغو استرداد refund cancellation"}];
